# Environment files
# .env.development and .env.production hold only public settings (API address,
# live-API switch) and ARE committed — the host builds with .env.production.
# Never commit secrets: put them in .env or *.local, which stay ignored.
.env
*.local
# Local test-only CMS mock (scripts/mock-cms-server.mjs)
.env.mock
scripts/mock-cms-server.mjs

